LATEST: Kelp claims that LayerZero approved the setup it blamed for $292 million bridge hack

The exploit, linked to a North Korean hacker group, led Kelp to migrate its rsETH off LayerZero's OFT standard to Chainlink's Cross-Chain Interoperability Protocol (CCIP).

